.TH ACTION_MAP_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_map_init \- Clear an ActionMap so every action is unbound
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "void action_map_init(ActionMap *m);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clear an ActionMap so every action is unbound. Call once (in on_enter, or at new game) before binding; a zeroed struct is not the same as an initialized one because KEY_NONE, PAD_NONE and AXIS_NONE are not zero.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_bind_key (3),
.BR ActionMap (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
